<item><title>Congo&apos;s senators press minister over crumbling roads and cut-off provinces</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-s-senators-press-minister-over-crumbling-roads-and-4a2b0f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-s-senators-press-minister-over-crumbling-roads-and-4a2b0f/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Lawmakers questioned Infrastructure Minister John Banza Lunda on the deterioration of roads and bridges and on several provinces being cut off.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:53:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-s-senators-press-minister-over-crumbling-roads-and-4a2b0f/share.jpg" length="46276" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-s-senators-press-minister-over-crumbling-roads-and-4a2b0f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
